  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to PCKK for JCM project formation in Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PCKK has been commissioned by the Government of Japan to promote JCM and to identify RE projects that could benefit from support.  As local consultant, the PA WA work shall involve: 1) finding and formation of projects to be implemented under the JCM; 2) providing logistical support to PCKK; and 3) information collection; and 4) reporting. The main aim of the work is to develop projects which can benefit from the JCM financing programmes to be offered by MOEJ after April 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
